WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.072
- [Woman] Okay, you ready
to check our progress?

00:00:02.072 --> 00:00:03.190
- [Children] Yeah.

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:04.272
- [Woman] All right, here we go.

00:00:04.272 --> 00:00:06.635
(children cheering)

00:00:06.635 --> 00:00:08.384
- [Children] Go, go, go, go, go.

00:00:08.384 --> 00:00:11.017
- [Children] 70, 70, 70.

00:00:11.017 --> 00:00:11.934
80, 80, 80.

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:14.325
- [Children] Not yet, not yet.

00:00:14.325 --> 00:00:16.393
(children cheering)

00:00:16.393 --> 00:00:18.771
(children stomping)

00:00:18.771 --> 00:00:21.771
(children cheering)

00:00:26.124 --> 00:00:29.223
(students clapping)

00:00:29.223 --> 00:00:32.306
(children cheering)

